From: byte <byte@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq8072-aw1000: add NSS nodes

AW1000 uses the NSS offload datapath, so pull in the shared
ipq8074 NSS description. The nss_region label is provided by
0600-0-arm64-dts-ipq8074-rename-nss-region.patch.

Signed-off-by: byte <byte@localhost>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq8072-aw1000.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq8072-aw1000.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq8072-aw1000.dts
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 #include "ipq8074.dtsi"
 #include "ipq8074-hk-cpu.dtsi"
 #include "ipq8074-ess.dtsi"
+#include "ipq8074-nss.dtsi"
 #include <dt-bindings/gpio/gpio.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/input/input.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/leds/common.h>
